OL,3,CMan take to hospital with serious
OL,4,Cinjuries after assault in Birmingham
OL,6,FA man's been taken to hospital with
OL,7,Fserious injuries after an assault in
OL,8,FBirmingham.
OL,10,FIt happened in Navigation Street, near
OL,11,FBirmingham New Street Station, just
OL,12,Fbefore 7am on Saturday, August 15.
OL,14,FPolice say a man in his 50s had been
OL,15,Fassaulted. Officers are now appealing
OL,16,Ffor people to come forward with
OL,17,Finformation.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
