OL,3,CMan take to hospital with serious
OL,4,Cinjuries after assault in Birmingham
OL,6,FA statement from West Midlands Police
OL,7,Freads: "We're investigating after a
OL,8,Fman was found injured in Navigation
OL,9,FStreet, Birmingham city centre, at
OL,10,Fjust before 6.40am on Saturday, August
OL,11,F15.
OL,13,F"It's understood the man, aged in his
OL,14,F50s, had been assaulted. He has been
OL,15,Ftaken to hospital with serious
OL,16,Finjuries.
OL,18,F"We're carrying out enquiries -
OL,19,Fincluding reviewing CCTV - as we seek
OL,20,Fto establish the full circumstances
OL,21,Fand identify who was involved."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
