OL,3,CMan take to hospital with serious
OL,4,Cinjuries after assault in Birmingham
OL,6,FAnyone with information can contact
OL,7,Fpolice via their Live Chat on their
OL,8,Fwebsite, or by calling 101, and
OL,9,Fquoting 20/343791/26.
